==English==
{{wikipedia|lang=en}}
[[File:SanDisk-Cruzer-USB-4GB-ThumbDrive.jpg|thumb|A flash drive]]

===Etymology===
So called because it is a [[memory drive]] that uses [[flash memory]].

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|computer hardware}} A small [[electronic]] device used to store [[digital]] [[data]], more [[portable]] and [[robust]] than a [[hard drive]].

====Synonyms====
* {{l|en|USB flash drive}}
* {{l|en|USB drive}}
* {{l|en|USB}}
* {{l|en|memory stick}}
* {{l|en|pen drive}}
* {{l|en|USB key}}
* {{l|en|jump drive}}
* {{l|en|thumb drive}}
*  disk-on-key

